window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Ruthless. Seductive. Survival</i></b>.</p> <p>Growing up as the daughter of one of England's most infamous mafia bosses, my life was always going to be a hot mess. Walking into Castle University, I'm not just another student—I'm the apex predator in a brutal game of power, betrayal, and dangerous lust.</p> <p>Everyone's a player in this savage game I was born into, and as a dark threat looms, tracking my every move, I get closer to four magnetic guys—my current housemates.</p> <p>They call themselves the <i>Kings of Castle.</i></p> <p><b>Raphael</b><i>: the strong, inked, seductive twin who leads this crew.</i></p> <p><b>Tarquin</b><i>: the equally sexy twin but with a lighter cloak on his shoulders.</i></p> <p><b>James</b>: <i>the smart and silent assassin with a seriously tempting dark side.</i></p> <p><b>Oliver</b><i>: the fun money man who knows me just by looking at me.</i></p> <p>The game’s on, the pieces are moving, and I’ll do whatever it takes to stay on top. In this ruthless world, you're either a king or a pawn, and I’m fighting not just for my legacy—I'm fighting to survive.</p> <p>When the endgame hits, will I rule Castle… or will it crush me?</p> <p><b>This is the first book of three in the Kings of Castle, a dark academia reverse harem with plenty of TWs—see author's website for details. Takes place in an entirely fictional world set in the UK.</b></p>"; 
